# Frontend

- New pages: `frontend/src/pages/PageName/PageName.jsx` + CSS Module, then register in `frontend/src/App.jsx`
- Colocate styles as `*.module.css` (Vite locals are camelCase)
- Use MUI only where nearby code already does; do not introduce Tailwind
- In-app navigation: React Router `<Link>`, not `<a href>`
- Update `Navbar.jsx` and `Footer.jsx` together when adding a public route
- Talk to the backend through `/api/...` (Vite proxies to Django in dev)
- Keep EmailJS keys in `VITE_*` env vars
- Event detail route is currently `events/:id` (no leading slash) — do not “fix” it unless that is the task
